# Readable primality and concise, statically typed collection functions.
assert 13 is prime.
assert 21 is not prime.
assert 1 is not prime.
assert 2 is prime.
let values be a list of 3, 5, 5, 7.
assert (avg of values) is greater than 4.
assert (var of values) is greater than 0.
assert (stddev of values) is greater than 0.
assert (total of values) is equal to 20.
assert (size of values) is equal to 4.
assert (size of (unique of values)) is equal to 3.
assert (head of values) is equal to 3.
assert (final of values) is equal to 7.
print "Prime and shorthand functions OK".
